Abstract = {Occurrence, distribution, seasonal variation and transport of pesticides
   in Yodo River basin, Japan were discussed. About 30 pesticides were
   detected in this study area. Their distribution and seasonal variation
   were distinguished in two groups by usage. Loads of pesticides applied
   to paddy field in agricultural area occupy the majority of load of
   downstream. In case of other pesticides, sum of tributaries flowed
   residential and urban area forms over 50\%.},
