Note = {3rd International Conference on Energy, Environment and Sustainable
   Development (EESD 2013), Shanghai, PEOPLES R CHINA, NOV 12-13, 2013},
Organization = {Shanghai Univ Elect Power; Shanghai Normal Univ},
Abstract = {Research on energy storage technology and intelligent control
   strategies, is the main research trend of ``green{''} strategic of
   electric traction technology under the new energy policy in the new
   century. It could help to achieve improvement on performance and quality
   of rail transport. Based on the dynamic performance design requirements
   of the target vehicle, this paper puts forward a set of hybrid power
   system which adapts to match schemes and energy control strategy in
   areas without electricity of power batteries and super capacitors in
   different working conditions. The test results of dynamic performance
   and energy control strategy show that the hybrid system satisfies the
   requirements of security and dynamic performance of the target vehicle,
   and also ensures higher energy use efficiency.
   It is the development trend of modem trams to build incorporate
   transport with green, humanities and intelligent({[}1]). Presently, most
   of the trams obtain power through catenary, the overhead catenary
   seriously affects urban development, and destructs the urban landscape.
   Therefore, in order to better adapt to the development needs of the
   modern city, the power supply technology with non-catenary has become a
   hot research work of trams at domestic and overseas. The power supply
   modes of modem trams that could be used in non-catenary areas including
   the third rail, induction and energy storage mode of battery/super
   capacitor({[}2]). Among them, the induction and the third rail require
   complex ground power systems along the rail, which need complex
   technology and high cost. The energy storage trams have become the focus
   on research and development at domestic and overseas, due to their
   advantages including low structural cost, easy maintenance, high safety
   reliability. Research on energy storage technology and intelligent
   control strategies, is the main research trend of ``green{''} strategic
   of electric traction technology under the new energy policy in the new
   century. It could help to achieve improvement on performance and quality
   of rail transport.},
