   ecological environmental protection as the main features of the
   eco-industrial development, and the city is divided into four functional
   areas, including the core area of the capital function, Urban Fringe's
   Sustainable Development, urban development zone, ecological conservation
   area, ecological conservation area mainly in the suburbs of Beijing. At
   present, how to Implement the ecological function and maintain rapid
   growth in economy of Ecological Conservation Area to guarantee economic
   health, balanced, sustainable development is a serious problem. This
   article discusses the approach of ``Kyoto Protocol{''} carbon trading
