   Beijing, PEOPLES R CHINA, DEC 15-17, 2010},
Abstract = {Kitchen waste as kind of urban solid residues, containing high crude
   cellulose and abundant of protein and fat, is a resource of feedstuff or
   compost. In this paper, the problems of comprehensive utilizations of
   kitchen wastes are studied, mainly including the safety of feedstuff
   from the wastes and the negative result of the high-salted in the
   compost. An effective integrated technique, including pre-disposal of
   collection, de-odorization, transportation, and storage, especially
   disinfection and desaltification, is developed to improve the efficiency
   of treatment of kitchen waste and the quality of feedstuff.},
