   Environm Canada; European Assoc Sci Air Pollut},
Abstract = {A method to use fences of activated carbon fiber (ACF) is presented to
   reduce high NO2, PM, and VOCs concentrations in urban atmosphere without
   excess energy use. Polluted air in road space moves with natural and
   car-induced winds to contact with and to flow through ACF fences, and
   the ACF layer removes these pollutants. That this ``energy-free{''}
   equipment can reduce high NOx by 15-50 \% at the roadside is numerically
   evaluated.},
