Abstract = {In order to produce overall beneficial result in Changzhutan port system
   of resource-saving and environment-friendly society, the position,
   effect and main function of each port need to be made clear. Space
   structure, hierarchy structure and function structure of Changzhutan
   port system are carried on quantitative analysis by calculating gini
   coefficient, HI index, R-type factor, location quotient and coefficient
   of labour division in this paper. The result of study is the basis for
   construction of port system of Changzhutan city groups and can provide a
