Abstract = {The number of the designs and the classifications of the game are
   increased lately. Following the number of increased digital games, human
   emotions and passions are hugely affected or motivated by the games
   while games are used in the field of psychological medication and
   society dominantly. The Abusive game design is studied by the frame
   analysis of Ervin Goffman in this study. The feelings of confusion and
   boredom are the game designs distracting the attention and penetration
