Abstract = {Unemployment is one of the macroeconomic problems that signal the
   inefficient use of capital resource in the market. The research on
   unemployment in the Districts of Kinta, Manjung and Kuala Kangsar in
   Perak aims to identify the issues and problems related to the
   unemployment as public participation has become a driver that determine
   the future generation. A survey on 203 of respondents conducted randomly
   was to assess the current socio-economic condition of unemployment.
   Issues identified such as mismatched in location of work and
   availability of workers and increase of foreign worker in the local
   labor market. Hence, several recommendations proposed to overcome the
   issues of unemployment in the study. (C) 2015 The Authors. Published by
