   Russian Acad Arts; Turkish Acad Sci; SGEM},
Abstract = {Background: In the article the process of forming holistic world outlook
   in education space of modern university through the synthesis of both
   cultures: scientific and humanitarian.
   Methods: The authors focus on the evolutionary-synergetic approach where
   transdisciplinary links, relations and interactions are integrated. The
   differences between disciplinary, interdisciplinary and
   transdisciplinary education structures are denoted.
   Results: The function of interdisciplinary synthesis in overwhelming
   cultures alienation is revealed. The potential of transdisciplinary
   approach in the system of higher education is fulfilled. The specificity
   of new type education in the context of epoch imperatives and new social
   practices are shown. The thesis that the holistic tendency maintains
   integrity originated from transdisciplinary coordination is proved.
