Abstract = {The desired future state of sustainability implies a paradigm shift in
   the way we live, work and play. Besides constructed quality and
   environmental quality, the quality of facilities in buildings has
   influential to the living quality of numerous occupants there. The
   functional quality of the facilities, in turn, is dependent on the
   quality of their operation and management. Since the birth of the
   sustainable development concept and its application to urban planning
   and construction projects, countless sustainability indicator sets have
   appeared. This paper analyses the main aspects of facility management
   services, in particular one of them.},
