   Stockholm Environm Inst; China Node Sustainable Sanitat; Beijing Environ
   Syst Co},
Abstract = {Domestic wastewater treatment by sand continuous filter has been studied
   in a bench scale test. The results indicate that this technology is
   feasible, and the effluent water quantity is better. The contents of
   effluent suspended solids (SS) and total phosphorus (TP) is both meet
   with first standards of urban sewage treatment plant pollutant discharge
   standard of China. And the removal efficiency of SS, COD, NH4+-N and TP
   is 84\%similar to 92\%, 58\%similar to 74\%, 46\%similar to 53\% and
   64\%similar to 87\%, respectively. The experimental study showed that
   sand filter on domestic wastewater treatment is feasible.},
